  "content": "<p>此模組新增了Macaw系列模組之間的相容性，例如橋樑/柵欄或屋頂。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>橋樑</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/182/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>柵欄</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/183/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>樹籬</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/185/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>屋頂</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/186/2024-08-27_01.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1.18.2+ 版本更新</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1106/295/2025-02-23_13.png\"></p><p><strong>必要依賴模組：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autoreglib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRegLib</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AddonsLib</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>選用模組：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw系列模組</a></p>",
